---
import SectionHeader from './SectionHeader.astro';
---

<section class="why-section" id="why">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <SectionHeader
      label="Why Foaps"
      title="Built different, on purpose."
      description="Every product we build starts with one question: what do Global business owners actually need?"
    />
    <div class="why-grid">
      <div class="why-card fade-up">
        <div class="why-icon" style="background:var(--orange-bg)">🚫</div>
        <h3>No hidden charges</h3>
        <p>What you see is what you pay. No per-order cuts, no surprise invoices, no fine print. Every Foaps product has transparent, flat pricing.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="why-card fade-up" style="transition-delay:.1s">
        <div class="why-icon" style="background:var(--green-bg)">🛫</div>
        <h3>Built from India for the world</h3>
        <p>Global-first payments, WhatsApp as the primary channel, and support for diverse needs — we build for how global businesses actually operate.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="why-card fade-up" style="transition-delay:.2s">
        <div class="why-icon" style="background:var(--blue-bg)">⚡</div>
        <h3>Up and running in hours</h3>
        <p>No 6-week implementation cycles. Connect your accounts, set up your profile, and start taking orders the same day. Onboarding is part of the product.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="why-card fade-up" style="transition-delay:.3s">
        <div class="why-icon" style="background:var(--purple-bg)">🔗</div>
        <h3>Products that work together</h3>
        <p>Use Receiver for delivery orders, Orderpipe for direct orders, and Engage to bring customers back. One ecosystem, one dashboard.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="why-card fade-up" style="transition-delay:.4s">
        <div class="why-icon" style="background:var(--amber-bg)">📞</div>
        <h3>Real human support</h3>
        <p>WhatsApp support that actually responds. For critical issues, call us. We don't hide behind ticket queues — we pick up.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="why-card fade-up" style="transition-delay:.5s">
        <div class="why-icon" style="background:var(--orange-bg)">📈</div>
        <h3>Grows with you</h3>
        <p>Start with one product. Add more as your business scales. Foaps grows alongside you — from your first outlet to your tenth.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .why-section {
    background: white;
    padding: 100px 6%;
  }

  .section-inner {
    max-width: 1180px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .why-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .why-card {
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 36px 32px;
    transition: transform 0.25s, box-shadow 0.25s;
  }

  .why-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-6px);
    box-shadow: 0 16px 48px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.07);
  }

  .why-icon {
    width: 52px;
    height: 52px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 24px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .why-card h3 {
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    letter-spacing: -0.4px;
  }

  .why-card p {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--ink-3);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .why-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
